('KOD-NAT-001', 'Koodai Bag', 'koodai-bag', 'apparel', 185000, 2, 'Koodai Bag from Pondicherry, Tamil Nadu. Woven by hand in coastal Pondicherry using traditional ribbed palm-leaf and wire technique. Lightweight, durable, and completely weatherproof.', ARRAY['#handmade', '#pondicherry', '#woven', '#sustainable', '#tote']::text[], '[{"url":"/products/p2_koodai-bag.jpeg","alt":"Koodai Bag from Pondicherry, Tamil Nadu","width":700,"height":700}]'::jsonb, true, 'Woven by hand in coastal Pondicherry using traditional ribbed palm-leaf and wire technique. Lightweight, durable, and completely weatherproof.', 'Pairs effortlessly with raw linen or cotton kurtas.', 220000, 'Pondicherry, Tamil Nadu', '[{"id":"var_002_natural","name":"Natural Palm","sku":"KOD-NAT-001","stock":2,"lowStockThreshold":3},{"id":"var_002_indigo","name":"Indigo Trim","sku":"KOD-IND-002","stock":2,"lowStockThreshold":3}]'::jsonb, true, 1, false, '2026-09-19T00:00:00Z'),
