('KSH-HB-001', 'Kashmiri Crewel Hand-Bag', 'kashmiri-crewel-hand-bag', 'apparel', 280000, 2, 'Kashmiri Crewel Hand-Bag from Kashmir. Chain-stitch Ari needlework on dense unbleached cotton duck cloth. Wool dyed with walnut shells and wild pomegranate peels.', ARRAY['#kashmir', '#crewel', '#embroidery', '#wool', '#bag']::text[], '[{"url":"/products/p9_hand-bag.jpeg","alt":"Kashmiri Crewel Hand-Bag from Kashmir","width":500,"height":333}]'::jsonb, true, 'Chain-stitch Ari needlework on dense unbleached cotton duck cloth. Wool dyed with walnut shells and wild pomegranate peels.', 'Roomy structured profile with leather reinforced trim.', 320000, 'Kashmir', '[{"id":"var_009_multi","name":"Forest Floral","sku":"KSH-HB-001","stock":2,"lowStockThreshold":2}]'::jsonb, false, NULL, false, '2026-09-19T00:00:00Z'),
